B.G0=A.a(s(["Developed a mobile app for a company selling fitness machines with **BLE capabilities,** enabling users to perform various training programs and track metrics like blood pressure and calories.","Created a **virtual training experience** where cycling video speed adjusts in real-time based on machine pedal speed and altitude, with **Chromecast support,** and added a map view feature showing the track using **GPS data** from the videos, allowing users to **track their position on a real-world route.**","Designed a **scalable architecture** to smoothly integrate new fitness machines with different **BLE protocols,** ensuring easy expansion and maintenance.","Integrated **10+ different fitness machines** using various BLE protocols for seamless communication and **real-time data syncing.**"]),t.s)
